9 is a 2009 animated post-apocalyptic science fiction horror thriller film directed by Shane
Acker based on his 2005 short film created at the UCLA Animation Workshop.

13
00:44:39,130 --> 00:44:45,130
The film was written by Pamela Pettler and produced by Jim Lemley,
Tim Burton, Timur Bekmambetov and Dana Ginsburg.

14
00:48:05,217 --> 00:48:11,217
Set in an alternate version of the 1940s, the film follows a rag doll labeled "9" who
awakens shortly after the end of humanity following the uprising of machines.

15
