Reilly, Jennifer Connelly, Christopher Plummer and Crispin
Glover, with Martin Landau and Fred Tatasciore.

17
00:58:23,478 --> 00:58:29,478
9 was released by Focus Features in theatres on September 9, 2009.

18
01:01:49,565 --> 01:01:55,565
The film received generally mixed reviews from critics, earned $48.4 million on a $30 million budget and received an
Outstanding Producer of Animated Theatrical Motion Pictures nomination in 21st Producers Guild of America Awards.

19
